# Objective

Detect additions to high-privilege Active Directory security groups.

DET-005 provides visibility into changes capable of significantly increasing an account's effective privileges within the domain.

Initial privileged-group coverage:

```text
Domain Admins
Enterprise Admins
Schema Admins
```

The controlled validation uses:

```text
Domain Admins
```

---

# Security Significance

Privileged group membership can provide extensive access to enterprise systems.

A membership change can therefore represent:

```text
Legitimate Administration
          OR
Privilege Escalation
          OR
Persistence
```

DET-005 does not assume malicious intent.

It generates a high-priority investigation signal.

