# Positive Validation

A fresh privileged membership event was generated after removing the account from Domain Admins.

Removal:

```powershell
Remove-ADGroupMember -Identity "Domain Admins" -Members det005test -Confirm:$false
```

Fresh addition:

```powershell
Add-ADGroupMember -Identity "Domain Admins" -Members det005test
```

Detection:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728 "Domain Admins" earliest=-10m
```

Result:

```text
DET-005 TRIGGERED
```

**Positive Test:** PASS

---

# Negative Validation

A standard security group was created:

```powershell
New-ADGroup -Name "DET005-NormalGroup" -GroupScope Global -GroupCategory Security
```

The test account was added:

```powershell
Add-ADGroupMember -Identity "DET005-NormalGroup" -Members det005test
```

The underlying group-management event was generated, but the target was not privileged.

DET-005:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728
("Domain Admins" OR "Enterprise Admins" OR "Schema Admins")
earliest=-10m
```

Result:

```text
DET-005 NOT TRIGGERED
```

**Negative Test:** PASS

