# Detection Limitations

DET-005 currently:

- Focuses primarily on global privileged groups
- Depends on Windows Security auditing
- Does not automatically validate change authorization
- Does not automatically identify compromised administrators
- Requires analyst context
- Does not cover every possible privilege-assignment mechanism
- Uses a deliberately understandable SPL implementation

Future iterations can incorporate additional group scopes and risk-based correlation.

